    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present to the market 29 The Laurels. A wonderful opportunity to purchase a spacious, A rated, 3 bedroom mid-terrace within a peaceful residential development with Terenure Village on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nCarefully maintained, retrofitted and with excellently proportioned accommodation bursting full of natural light from the large floor to ceiling windows to the rear of the property. The accommodation briefly comprises of entrance hall with cloaks area, comms room and guest w.c, off and access to the basement below. The living room is to the rear of the property with sealed wood burning stove, large picture windows and door overlooking garden. The kitchen is to the front of the property and is complete with a range of modern gloss units, subway tiled splashback, tiled floor, sink unit and extractor fan.  \r\n\r\nUpstairs is equally as spacious with Bedroom 1 to front has a fitted sliderobes, Bedroom 2 is to the rear with high quality laminate flooring and Bedroom 3 is to the front. There is a stylish family bathroom with bath, whb with storage, w.c and partly subway tiled walls. Off the landing is a large storage/hotpress and a most practical laundry room which is plumbed for washing machine and dryer. \r\n\r\nOutside to the rear is a secluded low maintenance garden benefitting from the southerly and westerly light laid out in lawn bordered by planting and raised beds and shed. Additionally there is ample parking, bin store, store.  \r\n\r\nThe Laurels is a small development off Terenure Road West, this is a prime and highly sought after location which needs little introduction with Terenure village less then a 5 minute stroll. The superb amenities of Bushy Park is also within walking distance. There are a wealth of shopping facilities and amenities to be found in the neighbouring villages of Rathgar, Templeogue and Rathfarnham. \r\n\r\nThere are a number of highly regarded primary and secondary schools are within minutes of your front door including Terenure and Templeogue Colleges, Our Lady's, Presentation College, St Pius X Boy's National School and The High School, Rathgar to name but a few. The City Centre is within easy commuting distance with a number of Dublin bus routes frequently passing through the village. The M50 network is closeby offering access to all major national routes.\r\n\r\nThis is an immaculate property which has been retrofitted to ensure easy modern day living,  in a highly accessible and popular residential location, viewing is recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall \r\nHigh quality laminate flooring, cloaks area, comms room off and access to basement. \r\n\r\nGuest w.c\r\nTiled floor, w.c, whb\r\n\r\nLiving / Dining\r\nHigh quality laminate wood flooring, sealed stove, alcove units, floor to ceiling windows to garden and patio door to garden\r\n\r\nKitchen \r\nExtensive range of overhead and undercounter modern gloss units, plumbed for dishwasher, sink unit, subway tiled splashback, extractor fan, tiled floor and large window overlooking front. \r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nBedroom 1 (Front)\r\nFitted sliderobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Rear)\r\nLaminate flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (Front) \r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nBath with shower attachment, w.c, whb with storage, towel radiator, tiled floor, partly subway tiled walls, mirror and vanity light. \r\n\r\nLanding \r\nLarge hot press with ample storage \r\n\r\nUtility / Laundry room \r\nPlumbed for washing machine and dryer."
      },
      {
